WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.766
Hi, my name is Javier Bambaren.

2
00:00:01.966 --> 00:00:03.766
I've been producing events for over 20 years

3
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:04.800
and I love it,

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.866
but I'm also aware of a huge pain point,

5
00:00:07.066 --> 00:00:08.900
the day-to-day operational chaos,

6
00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:09.933
where your information

7
00:00:10.366 --> 00:00:11.366
is split across

8
00:00:11.666 --> 00:00:15.666
Google Sheets, Drive, handwritten notes, calls,

9
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:16.466
WhatsApp messages,

10
00:00:16.466 --> 00:00:18.366
and in the end, you become the

11
00:00:18.466 --> 00:00:19.500
information bottleneck

12
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:22.266
between your client, your suppliers and your own office.

13
00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:24.600
Honestly, that's the reason I decided

14
00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:25.533
to create EventOS.

15
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.766
EventOS is an all-in-one platform

16
00:00:27.966 --> 00:00:30.500
where all your information can live, for your office

17
00:00:30.733 --> 00:00:32.700
and for your client, and everything is much easier.

18
00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:34.900
You can create your own floor plans,

19
00:00:35.133 --> 00:00:36.200
see your finances,

20
00:00:36.466 --> 00:00:38.666
see where the numbers are and always have the information

21
00:00:38.966 --> 00:00:39.600
at hand,

22
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.733
whenever you need it, whether on site

23
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.766
or in different meetings.

24
00:00:43.766 --> 00:00:44.200
I also

25
00:00:44.566 --> 00:00:46.300
noticed one more thing:

26
00:00:46.566 --> 00:00:49.466
events are amazing, we move a lot of money,

27
00:00:50.066 --> 00:00:51.266
but we don't realize

28
00:00:51.366 --> 00:00:53.666
where money is leaking, what's going on,

29
00:00:53.866 --> 00:00:54.933
those small everyday expenses,

30
00:00:55.266 --> 00:00:57.433
poor inventory control and everything else.

31
00:00:57.433 --> 00:00:58.000
If you want

32
00:00:58.166 --> 00:00:59.466
to know more, I recommend you check out

33
00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:00.200
this platform,

34
00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.166
because I built it from inside the industry,

35
00:01:02.466 --> 00:01:03.566
for the industry.

